# Force LF in the working tree on every platform.
#
# LicenseAudit ships committed sample artefacts (out/ reports + audited-
# project SBOMs and the sbom/ capability family). The compiler emits the
# SBOMs with LF on every OS, and the reports are produced with LF too,
# while a checkout with core.autocrlf rewrites committed LF to CRLF, so a
# regenerated file would differ from the checked-out one in its line
# endings alone. Every tracked file is text (.capa, .json, .txt, .csv,
# .md, .toml, .sh, LICENSE, SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH); a blanket eol=lf is safe.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Reproducibility inputs, pinned LF for defence in depth.
sbom/SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH text eol=lf
generate.sh            text eol=lf
